{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地女星虞書欣、宋雨琦、金晨及秦嵐等為拍攝綜藝節目，不帶助手及放下手機徒步上峨眉金頂習武修行。</p><p>不過眾人相當投入，尤其虞書欣及宋雨琦兩位年輕一輩，更是活力十足。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;內地全新真人騷《峨眉山來了群女弟子》開</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T16:25:59.356755+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T16:01:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T16:19:08.345939+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T16:19:08.345939+00:00","content_hash":"f8508443c89f40fea376c8bfd0577a98b9806efb40d62a0a6724c9a53ef2ee8c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}